  "description": "Teaching assistant Han Bom from the art department starts dating her longtime crush and fellow teaching assistant Nam Hae-Seong from a different department. But she gets approached by a promising art student Lee Yun-O.\n\nFor some reason, Nam Hae-Seong starts to avoid Bom after they start dating while Lee Yun-O waits for her everyday, tells her he loves her everyday, hugs her tightly and tells her to come to him everyday.\n\nThe person I love, the person who loves me, and my spring orchard of flowers, wine and candlelight.\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
